    "guide": { "type": "seo-guide", "settings": { "background": "default", "content": "<h2>Is your mattress too firm? A 5cm topper changes everything</h2><p>A mattress topper is a 5cm padded layer placed on top of your existing mattress. UAE residents buy them for three main reasons: their mattress has become too firm over 3+ years, they want hotel-bed softness without replacing a good mattress, or they're renting and can't replace the provided mattress.</p><h3>Width to bed size guide</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Width</th><th>Bed Size</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>120 cm</td><td>Single</td></tr><tr><td>150 cm</td><td>Small Double</td></tr><tr><td>160 cm</td><td>Double / Queen</td></tr><tr><td>180 cm</td><td>King</td></tr><tr><td>200 cm</td><td>Super King</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Fitting and care in UAE conditions</h3><p>MAYF Home's toppers sit flush with an elasticated skirt so they won't shift during the night. Machine wash on a gentle cycle and air-dry fully before refitting to avoid mildew in humid months.</p><h3>Protect it too</h3><p>A topper and a waterproof <a href=\"/collections/mattress-protectors\">mattress protector</a> work together: the topper adds comfort, the protector keeps sweat and spills out of both.</p>" } },
    "faq": { "type": "interior-faq", "blocks": {
      "f1": { "type": "faq", "settings": { "question": "What thickness mattress topper do I need in UAE?", "answer": "<p>MAYF Home's 5cm depth is the hotel-standard thickness — enough to soften a firm mattress without changing its support.</p>" } },
      "f2": { "type": "faq", "settings": { "question": "What is the difference between a mattress topper and a mattress protector?", "answer": "<p>A topper adds softness and comfort; a protector is a thin waterproof layer that guards against spills, dust and sweat. Many UAE homes use both together.</p>" } },
      "f3": { "type": "faq", "settings": { "question": "Does a mattress topper help with a firm mattress?", "answer": "<p>Yes — a 5cm microfibre topper is a simple, low-cost way to soften a mattress that feels too firm.</p>" } },
      "f4": { "type": "faq", "settings": { "question": "What size mattress topper do I need for a king bed in UAE?", "answer": "<p>180 cm width fits a standard UAE king mattress (180×200 cm).</p>" } },
      "f6": { "type": "faq", "settings": { "question": "Should I buy a mattress topper or a new mattress?", "answer": "<p>A topper changes how the surface feels; it can't fix support. If your mattress is simply too firm, a topper is the easy fix. If it sags, dips or you can feel the springs, it's time for a <a href=\"/collections/mattresses\">new mattress</a>.</p>" } },
      "f7": { "type": "faq", "settings": { "question": "Can a mattress topper help with back pain?", "answer": "<p>A topper adds comfort, not support, so it won't correct a mattress that has lost its shape. If you have back pain, speak to your doctor about your needs, and browse our <a href=\"/collections/orthopedic-mattresses\">orthopaedic mattresses</a> for firmer support.</p>" } },
      "f8": { "type": "faq", "settings": { "question": "How long does topper delivery take in the UAE?", "answer": "<p>Typically 2–3 working days across all seven emirates; orders placed before 4pm are dispatched the same working day. Delivery is free on orders over AED 500 — see our <a href=\"/pages/shipping-policy\">shipping policy</a>.</p>" } },
      "f5": { "type": "faq", "settings": { "question": "What is the price of a mattress topper in UAE?", "answer": "<p>MAYF Home toppers range from AED 130 for the 120 cm width to AED 190–195 for the 200 cm (super king) width. Pay in 4 with Tabby or Tamara.</p>" } }
